              <li className="flex items-center"><CheckCircle className="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-green-500" />개인 매칭도 높음 ({personalizedScore}%)</li>
              <li className="flex items-center"><CheckCircle className="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-green-500" />전문가 평가 양호</li>
